WEBVTT

00:11:30.008 --> 00:11:32.754
(Laughter)

00:11:35.975 --> 00:11:36.976
(Laughter ends)

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.976
In January of '08,

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.617
Oprah gave me four months
to prepare and train.

00:11:42.665 --> 00:11:45.633
So, I would sleep
in a hypoxic tent every night.

00:11:45.657 --> 00:11:49.976
A hypoxic tent is a tent
that simulates altitude at 15,000 feet.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.673
So, it's like base camp, Everest.

00:11:52.697 --> 00:11:57.976
What that does is, you start building up
the red bloodcell count in your body,

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.238
which helps you carry oxygen better.